<http://connectdigitalstudy.com/ontology#RapidsFeature_PHONE_LOCATIONS_BARNETT_BASE_rog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Radius of Gyration (rog) is a measure in meters of the area covered by a person over a day. A centroid is calculated for all the places (pauses) visited during a day, and a weighted distance between all the places and that centroid is computed. The weights are proportional to the time spent in each place." .
