<http://connectdigitalstudy.com/ontology#RapidsFeature_PHONE_LOCATIONS_BARNETT_BASE_siglocsvisited> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The number of significant locations visited during the day. Significant locations are computed using k-means clustering over pauses found in the whole monitoring period. The number of clusters is found iterating k from 1 to 200 stopping until the centroids of two significant locations are within 400 meters of one another." .
